{{Term/Store|Endura Shroom|Endura Shrooms|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Spoils"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Endura Shroom}}
Endura Shrooms are a rare type of [[Mushroom]] that are dotted around the various small forests within and outlining [[Hyrule Field]]. More concentrated amounts can be found in [[Hyrule Ridge]] within the [[Dalite Forest]] and at the base of the [[Tree]]s in the [[Seres Scablands]]. They can also be found in an unnamed forest behind [[Wetland Stable]]. Endura Shrooms can be purchased at the [[East Wind]] [[General Store]] in [[Hateno Village]].

[[Link]] can eat an Endura Shroom raw to restore one [[Heart]] [[Life Gauge]]. Alternatively, he can roast them near a [[Fire]] to create a [[Toasty Endura Shroom]], which increases the amount of Hearts restored to one and a half. When used in [[Cooking]], they grant the [[Extra Stamina]] [[Added Effect]], which gives Link extra [[Stamina]] on top of replenishing his Stamina to full.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>{{Note|Not to be confused with Energizing, which just replenishes Stamina.}} Endura Shrooms are also one of the [[Material]]s used by [[Sayge]] to create [[Orange Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] in [[Hateno Village]].

